            "dct:description": {
                "@language": "eng",
                "@value": "All the individual sociodemographic characteristics in this dataset are related to a reference period (year and month). Some variables can change from month to month (like the age or the residence). Others do not change (like the birth country). \nThis dataset is part of those provided by the IGSS within the framework of the Luxembourg Microdata Platform on Labour and Social Protection. All datasets offered by the IGSS are designed to be interoperable through the use of common pseudonymized identifiers, enabling the linkage of information across different datasets.\nAll the variables in this dataset are personal data and are subject to GDPR compliant protection measures. \nScope: all persons living in Luxembourg and/or affiliated to the Luxembourg social security system (including cross-border workers). \nDelay for providing the most recent data: current month -3. \nData source : CCSS."
            },
